   "source": [
    "#### __INTUITION__: \n",
    "\n",
    "- each of n observations lives in a p dimensional space, but not all dimensions are intersting.\n",
    "\n",
    "- PCA seeks small number of dimensions, where the \"interesting\" part is measured by the amount that the observations vary along each dimension\n",
    "\n",
    "- Each dimension of PCA is linear combination of _p_ features"
   ]
