    "## First principal component __PCA1__\n",
    "---\n",
    "### __Eigenvector and eigen values__\n",
    "\n",
    "#### A * x = lambda * x; where (x e R ) and x != 0\n",
    "\n",
    "- A: matrix\n",
    "\n",
    "- x: eigenvector\n",
    "\n",
    "- lambda: scaler of eigenvector"
